settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/bbe548fb-fff3-51cc-98b6-7d9ec531e32b_2.webp","title":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","text":"<p>Setup was super easy, and I love that everything runs from my phone. I was worried it would feel techy or complicated, but it’s actually really intuitive. My friends are already asking where they can get one for their own homes!”<\/p><p><strong>- Tony F.<\/strong><\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_gNm7wc":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/de4ca55f-9914-56dc-857a-34bcdc95c5e9_2.webp","title":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","text":"<p>“Took a few tries to calibrate, but once it clicked, it was magical. Watching movies with this light behind the screen is a whole new experience. Every scene feels bigger and more alive. It honestly transforms my living room into a mini theater. Totally worth it for the vibe alone.”<br\/><br\/><strong>- Daniel W.<\/strong><\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_hkqANj":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2563bd46-8c61-5758-b03c-fc5050b0fd4a_2.avif","title":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","text":"<p>“So far pretty good. I love how it adds to the atmosphere of watching movies way more than I anticipated! The TV looks larger with the lights behind it, and with a 75” it feels like I’m at the theatre lol. It’s wild how such a simple setup makes the whole room feel more alive. Like the movie is spilling out into my space.“<br\/><br\/><strong>- Linda H.<\/strong><\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["column_dMrDj9","column_JWe3FX","column_EjHHAp","column_gNm7wc","column_hkqANj"],"name":"t:sections.multicolumn.presets.name","settings":{"title":"See why 15,000+ customers LOVE their Cinema Immersion TV Backlight","heading_size":"h1","heading_center":"center","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"portrait","columns_desktop":5,"column_alignment":"center","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"navigation_on_mobile":fal